---
title: vote.tiebreaker=no-lynch のとき同票で誰も処刑されず次の Night に進む
setup: { werewolf: 1, villager: 3 }
rules:
  vote.final: final
  vote.tiebreaker: no-lynch
  general.first-victim: none
---
# 4 人村で Day 2 に 4-way 同票 → no-lynch (誰も処刑なし) → Night 2 で
# wolf (Alice) が Carol を襲撃 → Day 3 で wolf 処刑 → 終局。
# 観察: execution event は Day 3 で 1 回のみ (Day 2 では起きない)、 最終 villager_won。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=人狼
!Bob=村人
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人
!Alice 1夜 襲撃 Carol

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Bob→Carol
Carol→Dave
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# 4-way 同票 → no-lynch (誰も処刑なし)
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 2 (state.day=3) ==
# wolf Alice が Carol 襲撃
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Bob
Bob→Alice
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 3 (state.day=3) ==
# Alice 2 / Bob 1 → execution=Alice → villager_won
# == end ==

# @expect-result: villager_won
# @expect-finished: true
# @expect-status Carol: dead
# @expect-cause Carol: night_kill
